# Joined Researchers // Secret Rendezvous: the intervening "if" is checked as the ability resolves too (CR 603.4). At
# Bot1's end step on turn three Bot2 has six cards to Bot1's five, so the ability triggers; Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt in
# response, leaving five each, and when it resolves the Researchers does not become prepared.

